    {
      "source": "<a href=\"RedisConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>RedisConverter</code></a> implementation creating flat binary map structure out of a given domain type. Considers\n<a href=\"../index/Indexed.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.redis.core.index\"><code>Indexed</code></a> annotation for enabling helper structures for finder operations. <br/>\n<br/>\n<strong>NOTE</strong> <a href=\"MappingRedisConverter.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert\"><code>MappingRedisConverter</code></a> is an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>InitializingBean</code></a> and requires\n<a href=\"#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> to be called.\n\n<pre><code>\n@RedisHash(\"persons\")\nclass Person {\n\n  @Id String id;\n  String firstname;\n\n  List&lt;String&gt; nicknames;\n  List&lt;Person&gt; coworkers;\n\n  Address address;\n  @Reference Country nationality;\n}\n</code>\n</pre>\n\nThe above is represented as:\n\n<pre><code>\n_class=org.example.Person\nid=1\nfirstname=rand\nlastname=al'thor\ncoworkers.[0].firstname=mat\ncoworkers.[0].nicknames.[0]=prince of the ravens\ncoworkers.[1].firstname=perrin\ncoworkers.[1].address.city=two rivers\nnationality=nationality:andora\n</code>\n</pre>",
      "translation": "<a href=\"RedisConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert 包中的接口\"><code>RedisConverter</code></a> 实现将给定的领域类型转换为扁平的二进制映射结构。该实现会考虑 <a href=\"../index/Indexed.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.index 包中的注解接口\"><code>Indexed</code></a> 注解，以启用查找操作的辅助结构。<br/>\n<br/>\n<strong>注意：</strong><a href=\"MappingRedisConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.redis.core.convert 包中的类\"><code>MappingRedisConverter</code></a> 是一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/InitializingBean.html\" title=\"org.springframework.beans.factory 包中的类或接口\"><code>InitializingBean</code></a>，需要调用其 <a href=\"#afterPropertiesSet()\"><code>afterPropertiesSet()</code></a> 方法。<br/>\n\n<pre><code>\n@RedisHash(\"persons\")\nclass Person {\n\n  @Id String id;\n  String firstname;\n\n  List&lt;String&gt; nicknames;\n  List&lt;Person&gt; coworkers;\n\n  Address address;\n  @Reference Country nationality;\n}\n</code>\n</pre>\n\n上述内容表示为：\n\n<pre><code>\n_class=org.example.Person\nid=1\nfirstname=rand\nlastname=al'thor\ncoworkers.[0].firstname=mat\ncoworkers.[0].nicknames.[0]=prince of the ravens\ncoworkers.[1].firstname=perrin\ncoworkers.[1].address.city=two rivers\nnationality=nationality:andora\n</code>\n</pre>",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
